      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montpelier%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1875 Montpelier was incorporated as a village, formalizing its local government and community structure.",
