      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Montpelier%2C_Ohio"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The Williams County Historical Museum, located on the fairgrounds, opened in 1965 and showcases regional artifacts.",
